			(property "Description" "USB-to-UART bridge, QFN-24; carrier-local copy of Interface_USB:CP2102N-Axx-xQFN24, re-pinned for clean escape lanes. ALL power/reset pins (VREGIN 7 / VDD 6 / VIO 5 / VBUS 8 / ~{RST} 9) are grouped on the LEFT edge so their decoupling caps + VBUS divider fan LEFT, away from the signal lanes; ALL SIX signal pins TXD (21) / RXD (20) / ~{RTS} (19) / ~{CTS} (18) / D+ (3) / D- (4) are spread to a 5.08 mm pitch on the RIGHT edge (no caps there), each getting its own clear outboard label lane; the unused/NC pins are packed below them and GND sits alone on the bottom edge. Pin numbers/names match the stock symbol, so the netlist is identical."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(show_name no)
				(do_not_autoplace no)
				(hide yes)
				(effects
					(font
						(size 1.27 1.27)
					)
				)
			)
